k u for giving me separate room in separate corner of the house. i sleep at 4 am here.\""}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1190.87, "timestamp": "00:19:50", "text": "主意。我的意思是，我认识其他一些油管博主。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1194.63, "timestamp": "00:19:54", "text": "完成了。我只能说，好吧，没关系。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1195.905, "timestamp": "00:19:55", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "@NINJA, Joq's Concert Plate he wont introduce us, he's ashamed of us :("}]